      "description": "stale revision discard + duplicate collapse. monotonic clock 기반 state machine",
      "entry": ["src/revision-guard.ts (신규)"],
      "scope": [
        "(guard-stale-revision incoming-revision current-revision)",
        "incoming >= current: accept (state update)",
        "incoming < current: discard (ct-3)",
        "incoming == current (재수신): no-op (ct-4)",
        "revision overflow: monotonic 32-bit unsigned"
      ],
      "success": [
